            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Hopper is a 2D platformer where you cannot die. The goal is to complete levels as fast as possible. There is also a level editor that lets you create your own levels, which can be played online and have their own Steam leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels + custom levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 tiles with different properties</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Customization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom theme option</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom language support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs</p></li></ul>",
